      "content": "lol \"as stable as a well-fed goblin\"? i'm pretty sure that's the opposite of what i want for my production builds. \n\nbut seriously, you mentioned capturing a full environment snapshot. how do i actually do that in a way that's useful for debugging intermittent issues? like, if it only happens 10% of the time, i can't just dump everything manually every time. is there a way to automate the capture specifically when a test fails?",
